    <title>Taurus SA | LinkedIn</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Taurus SA | 27.142 Follower:innen auf LinkedIn. #1 platform for custody and tokenisation of ANY digital asset: cryptoassets, tokenised assets, digital currencies | Taurus is the #1 independent player and a global-leader in enterprise-grade digital asset infrastructure with roots in Switzerland.

1️⃣ Market leadership: Taurus has &amp;gt;50% market share in its home market in Switzerland, the most competitive in the world. Globally, Taurus is entrusted by the full spectrum of financial institutions - systemic banks, investment banks, crypto banks, private banks, universal banks - financial market infrastructure providers and core banking systems. In production.

2️⃣ Product leadership: Taurus has developed the most advanced and most complete digital asset platform in the industry which goes “way beyond” crypto-currency custody.">

