  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">Tomorrow at <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/digital-assets-week?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Digital Assets Week</a> London, <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/in/kylielynpoole?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Kylie Poole, MBA</a>, Sales Director UK &amp; Nordics at Taurus, will join a panel tackling one of the central questions for institutions entering digital assets: how should custody be structured?

Digital Asset Custody: Regulated Custodian? Self-Custody? Build? Buy?

The discussion will look at the different custody models available to institutions and what each means for control, compliance, cost, security, and counterparty risk.

Kylie will be joined by <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/in/simonbarnby?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Simon Barnby</a> (CMO, <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/archaxex?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Archax</a>), <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/in/jasper-williams-110164169?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Jasper Williams</a> (Digital Custody Product, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/state-street?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>State Street</a>), <a class="link" href="https://ch.linkedin.com/in/jacquesboschung?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Jacques Boschung</a> (CEO, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/halborn?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Halborn</a>), and <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/in/daniel-elsawey-25201227?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Daniel Elsawey</a> (Global Head of Partnerships, <a class="link" href="https://at.linkedin.com/company/bitpanda-enterprise?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Bitpanda Enterprise</a>),

🔹 Wednesday, October 7
🔹 10:50 AM

More details here: <a class="link" href="https://daweek.org/london/?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://daweek.org/london/</a></p>
