  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        attributed-text-segment-list__content-truncated" dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">A strong <a class="link" href="https://be.linkedin.com/showcase/sibos/?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Sibos</a> week in Miami, made even better by an evening with clients and partners.🌴

Together with <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/stellar-development-foundation?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Stellar Development Foundation</a>, we co-hosted a private dinner with leaders from banking and digital assets, with <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/lamine-brahimi-cfa-393483?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Lamine Brahimi, CFA</a>, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/milenakohlhofer?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Milena Kohlhofer</a>, <a class="link" href="https://ae.linkedin.com/in/bashirkazour?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Bashir Kazour</a>, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/zacharydbender?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Zachary Bender</a>, and Bruno Reis joining from Taurus.

As we continue to expand in the U.S., we’re seeing growing engagement from financial institutions across the market. The evening was a great opportunity to reconnect with clients and partners and spend time with many of the institutions driving that interest.

Thank you to the <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/stellar-development-foundation?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Stellar Development Foundation</a> and everyone who joined us!🤝</p>
          
            
                  
    

