  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">Chainlink CCIP 2.0 is now live.

Taurus is pleased to be a strategic launch partner, supporting more secure and scalable interoperability for institutional digital assets.

As <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/lamine-brahimi-cfa-393483?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Lamine Brahimi, CFA</a>, Co-Founder and Managing Partner at Taurus, said:

"Chainlink CCIP is a key standard for how digital assets are managed and distributed across global markets, enabling assets to move seamlessly between blockchains while maintaining institutional security, compliance, and operational controls."

Learn more: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/eCk6GE-4?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/eCk6GE-4</a>

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/chainlink-labs?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Chainlink Labs</a></p>
