  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">Next week in Miami, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/milenakohlhofer?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Milena Kohlhofer</a>, our Strategic Partnerships Executive, will be speaking at <a class="link" href="https://be.linkedin.com/showcase/sibos/?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Sibos</a> on the infrastructure behind intraday repo.

Together with <a class="link" href="https://ae.linkedin.com/in/renemichau?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Rene Michau</a> from <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/standardchartered?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Standard Chartered</a>, Jonathan Chambers from <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/us-bank?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>U.S. Bank</a>, <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/in/craig-perrin-9a5a2115?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Craig Perrin</a> from <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/zodiacustody?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Zodia Custody</a>, and <a class="link" href="https://fr.linkedin.com/in/philippe-redaelli?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Philippe Redaelli</a> from <a class="link" href="https://fr.linkedin.com/company/kaikodata?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Kaiko</a>, she’ll explore the infrastructure, settlement, liquidity, and collateral requirements behind intraday repo.

<a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/in/natasha-benson-06128a15?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Natasha Benson</a> of <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/ownera?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Ownera</a> will moderate the session.

📅 Monday, September 28 at 9:00 AM ET

If you are attending, join us for the discussion and meet the Taurus team.</p>
