    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">"Over the last 12 months, digital assets have moved from being kind of a niche initiative to being a C-level agenda point."

In his recent interview with <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/fintech-magazine-bizclik?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>FinTech Magazine</a>, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/lamine-brahimi-cfa-393483?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Lamine Brahimi, CFA</a>, Co-founder and Managing Partner at Taurus, discusses our integration with <a class="link" href="https://be.linkedin.com/company/swift?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Swift</a>’s blockchain-based shared ledger, the opportunity for Swift members, and how financial institutions can use it to support tokenized deposits and 24/7 cross-border payments. 

👉 Read the full interview: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/eNGRmxk8?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/eNGRmxk8</a></p>
