    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">This week, security and risk leaders are gathering in London for the <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/gartner?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Gartner</a> Security &amp; Risk Management Summit.

